## 3. Key Features

### A. For Muted / Deaf Participants (Sign Language Users)
1. **Real-time ASL Hand Tracking**:
   - MediaPipe Hands tracks 21 landmarks at 30-60 FPS.
   - Toggleable high-tech neon skeleton overlay directly on their local video feed.
2. **Instant SignBridge Inference**:
   - Classifies gesture into letters A-Z, space, del, or resting/nothing.
   - Shows active prediction and confidence percentage badge.
3. **Smart Temporal Gesture Stabilizer & Word Builder**:
   - Majority voting over a rolling window (e.g., 10-15 frames) to eliminate jitter.
   - Hold-duration detection (holds gesture for ~600ms to confirm a letter).
   - Word buffer: appends letters, auto-spaces on `'space'`, backspaces on `'del'`.
   - Word completion and quick phrases ("Hello", "Thank you", "Yes", "No", "Please wait", "I agree", etc.).
4. **Automatic Voice Synthesis (Text-to-Speech)**:
   - When the muted user finishes a word/sentence or clicks speak, browser speech synthesis vocalizes the words aloud so hearing participants hear them naturally.
5. **Live Caption Broadcast**:
   - Generated sign captions are instantly pushed to all meeting participants' screens with the tag `[🤟 Name (Sign Language)]`.

### B. For Normal / Hearing Participants (Speakers)
1. **Live Speech-to-Text (STT)**:
   - Uses Web Speech Recognition to transcribe spoken words in real time.
   - Subtitles immediately appear on the muted participant's screen with `[🎙️ Name (Voice)]`.
2. **ASL Reference Dictionary Drawer**:
   - Cheatsheet of ASL signs (A-Z and common gestures) so hearing participants can learn or reference sign meanings during the meeting.

### C. Major Meeting Conferencing Capabilities
1. **Modern Meeting Lobby**:
   - Enter name, select role (`Mute / Signer 🤟`, `Hearing / Speaker 🎙️`, or `Dual / Interpreter`), test camera and mic, preview live hand landmark tracking before joining.
   - Create new meeting room (generates unique Room ID) or join with Room ID.
2. **In-Meeting Video Grid**:
   - Responsive multi-participant layout.
   - Status indicators (Sign tracking on/off, mic muted, speaking indicator).
3. **Google Meet / Zoom-Style Floating Live Caption Bar**:
   - Real-time animated subtitle banner displaying who is signing/speaking with distinct color coding.
4. **Meeting Controls Dock**:
   - Camera toggle, Mic toggle, Hand Skeleton toggle, Captions (CC) toggle, Voice Synthesis toggle, Screen Share, In-Meeting Chat, ASL Reference Drawer, Transcript Drawer, Leave Meeting.
5. **Meeting Transcript & Export**:
   - Full time-stamped history of the conversation (both signed and spoken lines).
   - "Download Transcript" (.txt / .json) button for post-meeting documentation.
6. **Sign Simulator & Test Mode**:
   - Allows testing the sign captioning pipeline, word buffer, and TTS even without a webcam or when demonstrating without physical signing.

